<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>For You ❤️</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>For You ❤️</h1>
            <p>Tap each card to unlock a little love fron camelia.</p>
        </header>

        <main class="grid">
            <div class="card" onclick="flipCard(this)">
                <div class="front">No.1</div>
                <div class="back">As long as i am alive you'll always have someone who is proud of you.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="flipCard(this)">
                     <div class="front">No.2</div>
                <div class="back">For you I'll stay up even when i don't want to just to hear you talk more.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="flipCard(this)">
                <div class="front">No.3</div>
                <div class="back">For all the days that you made me feel loved and appreciated. i am out of words to tell how grateful i am to have you.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="card" onclick="flipCard(this)">
                <div class="front">Secret Note</div>
                <div class="back">You mean the absolute world to me. I will choose you everytime. You matter more than you'll ever know. I love you to the moon and back ❤️</div>
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
